smokestacks","x":1880,"y":3420,"z":16.57,"n":7,"poem":"02","era":[3,4,"smokestacks"],"evidence":["C0432","C2310","C0220","C0381","C2473","C1003","C0349"],"rot":1.785,"r":16},{"type":"Angel of Independence","name":"Angel of Independence","x":5638,"y":3278.4,"z":17.59,"n":5,"poem":"07","era":[2,9,null],"evidence":["C1955","C0288","C0202","C0544","C0497"],"rot":0.259,"r":16},{"type":"Torre Latinoamericana","name":"Torre Latinoamericana","x":5998.5,"y":2953.2,"z":7.32,"n":4,"poem":"08","era":[3,9,null],"evidence":["C1843","C0183","C1713","C0004"],"rot":4.627,"r":28},{"type":"Washington Monument, Mount Vernon","name":"Washington Monument, Mount Vernon","x":2093.9,"y":2273.5,"z":22.88,"n":3,"poem":"01","era":[2,9,null],"evidence":["C0399","C1549","C1175"],"rot":1.909,"r":16},{"type":"Pyramid of the Sun","name":"Pyramid of the Sun","x":5420.5,"y":3574.7,"z":43.73,"n":2,"poem":"05","era":[0,9,null],"evidence":["C0852","C0487"],"rot":0.408,"r":90}],"words":[{"poem":"01","t":"What we've made we don't want, what we've sold to the world, to ourselves, doesn't exist.","x":2116.9,"y":2326.6,"z":22.4},{"poem":"01","t":"I look for a way out through the hallways, within the drawers and fire escapes, trip","x":2098.7,"y":2352.2,"z":22},{"poem":"01","t":"on my own words, falling out of life, and find where you go when you leave.","x":2061.6,"y":2347.6,"z":21.8},{"poem":"01","t":"It was the maze constructed by a tainted love, a known yet unknown pit beneath the quicksands","x":2045.5,"y":2307.4,"z":22.4},{"poem":"01","t":"of the make-believe haven, and hidden in the overnourished forest of escapism that calls","x":2076.4,"y":2269.1,"z":23},{"poem":"01","t":"At this age, I'll follow, following the full distance between us almost having it all and","x":2130.9,"y":2278.3,"z":23},{"poem":"02","t":"I heard a scream for help while falling with my headlights off.","x":1573.3,"y":1268,"z":3.3},{"poem":"02","t":"It was a type of silent scream a trap lover makes to escape a pending marriage,","x":1555.1,"y":1293.6,"z":4},{"poem":"02","t":"a concussion, a set of walls caving inward, seething and simmering,","x":1518,"y":1289,"z":3.6},{"poem":"02","t":"and a solitude of crowds and smiles.","x":1501.9,"y":1248.8,"z":2.7},{"poem":"02","t":"I received an emergency call while tossing and turning.","x":1532.8,"y":1210.5,"z":2.1},{"poem":"02","t":"It was a type of silent call a man makes to the mirror after midnight.","x":1587.3,"y":1219.7,"z":0.7},{"poem":"03","t":"Old to forever, a tambourine sounds off an empty temple, empty choir stands, empty prayer lines, and abandoned Baptist pools,","x":3447,"y":3887.2,"z":1.9},{"poem":"03","t":"pews taken by cobwebs, and doused in disintegration.","x":3428.8,"y":3912.8,"z":5.4},{"poem":"03","t":"Spirits have left salvations and opened gift boxes placed outside the side doors.","x":3391.7,"y":3908.3,"z":10.9},{"poem":"03","t":"It thunders, then it rains until nothing remains.","x":3375.6,"y":3868.1,"z":7.1},{"poem":"03","t":"Old to the storm ending, what was once love now goods,","x":3406.5,"y":3829.8,"z":0},{"poem":"03","t":"broken and sealed apart by lightning,","x":3461,"y":3839,"z":0},{"poem":"04","t":"What if I follow this trail to where the broken pieces have washed ashore and the ashes of expired wildfires","x":5127,"y":3547.2,"z":3.3},{"poem":"04","t":"cover sands and debris","x":5108.8,"y":3572.8,"z":3.6},{"poem":"04","t":"lift it from the night seawater's floor.","x":5071.7,"y":3568.3,"z":0},{"poem":"04","t":"The waves will calm to fold it whispers and the winds will mute the trees for the right level of silence","x":5055.6,"y":3528.1,"z":0},{"poem":"04","t":"to find a throbbing heart left at the midlife corner returned toward the incline.","x":5086.5,"y":3489.8,"z":0},{"poem":"04","t":"which has shaken off every sad blue note life can perform","x":5141,"y":3499,"z":0},{"poem":"05","t":"They tell me to ask if I can inherit the earth,","x":5138.3,"y":3540.3,"z":3.3},{"poem":"05","t":"to ask if I can name my own stars, even galaxies if I may.","x":5120,"y":3565.9,"z":5.8},{"poem":"05","t":"The past too was waiting for me.","x":5083,"y":3561.4,"z":0},{"poem":"05","t":"Coming of age in the shared rooms of human basements","x":5066.8,"y":3521.2,"z":0},{"poem":"05","t":"as bedrooms, mattress pads where the wood beams","x":5097.8,"y":3482.8,"z":0},{"poem":"05","t":"of southern pine could comfort my spine, it didn't.","x":5152.3,"y":3492.1,"z":0},{"poem":"06","t":"The gates open with wings gifted from evolution, and made of marble stones","x":5147,"y":3547.2,"z":3.2},{"poem":"06","t":"kissed by the hymns our creator composed with an orchestra of our ancestors wildest dreams to","x":5128.8,"y":3572.8,"z":5.8},{"poem":"06","t":"welcome us. Poets who eased generations down yellow brick roads and plucked our souls out","x":5091.7,"y":3568.3,"z":0},{"poem":"06","t":"of their secret places to follow comets to the capital city of our collective consciousness,","x":5075.6,"y":3528.1,"z":0},{"poem":"06","t":"resurrecting Atlantis. Here we are all one. The pack we've made here with nature","x":5106.5,"y":3489.8,"z":0},{"poem":"06","t":"abandon and hope for the best back on life. A relearned currency we reassess as a mission,","x":5161,"y":3499,"z":0},{"poem":"07","t":"DJ turn me up please. With eyes wide shut and my chin nested at the arc of the weight of these","x":5628.5,"y":3238.1,"z":18.3},{"poem":"07","t":"spoken words, I have a story to tell. Of ghosts whispering unfolded delusions, birthed in purity","x":5610.3,"y":3263.6,"z":18.2},{"poem":"07","t":"and dying and the veneers of sun-soaked evergreen fields are nourished. A love story of one by one","x":5573.2,"y":3259.1,"z":19.5},{"poem":"07","t":"treasures escaping and devaluing themselves after defamed unsalted stars diminish their glares.","x":5557,"y":3218.9,"z":20.4},{"poem":"07","t":"And I've walked a thousand light years across the greatest divide to be heard. So DJ please turn me","x":5588,"y":3180.6,"z":20.2},{"poem":"07","t":"up. So I can speak of wedding bands diverging across abstract skies of wounded souls. Of a","x":5642.5,"y":3189.8,"z":19.3},{"poem":"08","t":"The soul has escaped my body for the moment and left him on the dance floor. He can now just be","x":6025.5,"y":2960.5,"z":6.3},{"poem":"08","t":"flesh and bones, rejection and heartache hit differently when there are no feelings afloat.","x":6007.3,"y":2986.1,"z":7.3},{"poem":"08","t":"I want my soul now to imagine my body pulsing and head throbbing from the music and empty on","x":5970.2,"y":2981.5,"z":8.9},{"poem":"08","t":"a crowded floor of sweated perfumes and temptations. Let's watch strangers collide and spark electric","x":5954,"y":2941.3,"z":9.7},{"poem":"08","t":"currents that gamut the mood, a good one. We want him to be the last one to leave, prolonging the","x":5985,"y":2903,"z":8.2},{"poem":"08","t":"bitter refraction inside the walls of an escape that few pleasures offer us. Now let us put my","x":6039.5,"y":2912.2,"z":7},{"poem":"09","t":"Accepting you'll never say nor ever feel, my love was real.","x":6117.2,"y":2881.2,"z":6.8},{"poem":"09","t":"What isn't mine I still cannot give.","x":6098.9,"y":2906.8,"z":6.4},{"poem":"09","t":"I gather my things to go.","x":6061.9,"y":2902.3,"z":6.4},{"poem":"09","t":"Before I go, we look at the moon the way we used to see it","x":6045.7,"y":2862.1,"z":7.8},{"poem":"09","t":"and settle down the stillnessism.","x":6076.7,"y":2823.8,"z":8.2},{"poem":"09","t":"We talk for years and travel through time","x":6131.2,"y":2833,"z":7.3},{"poem":"10","t":"I wasn't looking for a ride, but here you are, blissful and oddly sensitive,","x":5928.9,"y":2952.2,"z":10.7},{"poem":"10","t":"withering a soul purveying both the dark and the light worlds I've known.","x":5910.7,"y":2977.8,"z":11.8},{"poem":"10","t":"So I rub my aggressions into your steel coverings and hop on to amuse myself.","x":5873.6,"y":2973.2,"z":12.4},{"poem":"10","t":"Loneliness is having everything with no one to tell,","x":5857.4,"y":2933,"z":12.6},{"poem":"10","t":"being everywhere with no one to love and escape,","x":5888.4,"y":2894.7,"z":11.2},{"poem":"10","t":"wide-eyed and stone but alive and well, wandering with no clear end.","x":5942.9,"y":2903.9,"z":9.6},{"poem":"11","t":"Even here is chilly in the morning.","x":3447,"y":3847.2,"z":0},{"poem":"11","t":"River rafting fall covers the seas in the distance","x":3428.8,"y":3872.8,"z":1.9},{"poem":"11","t":"and hugs the bases of tree-covered hills.","x":3391.7,"y":3868.3,"z":5.1},{"poem":"11","t":"This world is at peace.","x":3375.6,"y":3828.1,"z":2.6},{"poem":"11","t":"In silent resounds, choir chords calm the nerves of things I can't control","x":3406.5,"y":3789.8,"z":0},{"poem":"11","t":"and offer them as keepsakes back to the higher powers.","x":3461,"y":3799,"z":0},{"poem":"12","t":"Decades later, there was less time for words and more space for laughter, hugs with no reason,","x":3449,"y":4188.7,"z":27.5},{"poem":"12","t":"loud voices so our hearts can be overheard. My mind drifts into the darkness of our afterlives,","x":3430.8,"y":4214.3,"z":27.4},{"poem":"12","t":"and those rooms are empty. We are all here, each holding our glasses of burning sands","x":3393.7,"y":4209.8,"z":28.2},{"poem":"12","t":"and known journeys, and grateful to every living tree in the forest for the shared years","x":3377.5,"y":4169.6,"z":30.3},{"poem":"12","t":"and the shared memories. This is brotherhood. Smiles with no reason,","x":3408.5,"y":4131.3,"z":31.5},{"poem":"12","t":"narrow differences so our hearts can be overheard. Decades later, we can place our ears upon the next","x":3463,"y":4140.5,"z":28.2},{"poem":"13","t":"I want you to notice me in a corner cafe","x":2727,"y":2547.2,"z":1.6},{"poem":"13","t":"at the Harbor of the Heavens, wandering in thought,","x":2708.8,"y":2572.8,"z":1.6},{"poem":"13","t":"discovering water on Jupiter's moons,","x":2671.7,"y":2568.3,"z":5.8},{"poem":"13","t":"healing the sick with silent prayers","x":2655.6,"y":2528.1,"z":9.9},{"poem":"13","t":"and molding a better world to return to","x":2686.5,"y":2489.8,"z":6.5},{"poem":"13","t":"with every pulsing beat after walking alone.","x":2741,"y":2499,"z":2.1},{"poem":"14","t":"Don't make me leave and go where promises, hearts,","x":2167.2,"y":2043.6,"z":26.6},{"poem":"14","t":"spectrums of light-filled constellations are broken.","x":2149,"y":2069.2,"z":26.2},{"poem":"14","t":"I escaped here for a reason,","x":2111.9,"y":2064.7,"z":25.5},{"poem":"14","t":"believing this would give me a sharpened key of answers","x":2095.7,"y":2024.5,"z":24.3},{"poem":"14","t":"in a more grounded bravado","x":2126.7,"y":1986.2,"z":24.9},{"poem":"14","t":"for my life of conquests and queries.","x":2181.2,"y":1995.4,"z":26.2}]}